; t-update: the update check against GitHub through PrismNet, on a stock A1200
; CPU (the gate runs it on "PrismNet a1200 14", a 68020 at 14 MHz): GitHub closed
; the connection after an 18.6 s TLS handshake there (2026-11-06). AmiSSL is
; assigned from DH0:PrismNet/amissl for this boot only.
FailAt 21
Copy DH0:PrismNet/cfg/dhcp ENV:PrismNet ALL QUIET
C:PrismNet START >NIL:
Assign LIBS: DH0:PrismNet/amissl ADD
DH0:PrismNet/PrismNetUpdate SOURCE=GITHUB >DH0:PrismNet/update.log
If ERROR
  Echo "update check -> FAIL" >>DH0:PrismNet/update.log
Else
  Echo "update check -> PASS" >>DH0:PrismNet/update.log
EndIf
C:PrismNet STOP >>DH0:PrismNet/update.log
